# ThyTrader agent operations

When diagnosing a running instance, mutating research artifacts, or controlling paper/live deployments, follow the skills of record:

- `skills/thytrader-operator/SKILL.md` — read-only diagnostics
- `skills/thytrader-research/SKILL.md` — drafts, publish, backtests with `--confirm`
- `skills/thytrader-runtime/SKILL.md` — paper/live start/pause/resume/stop with `--confirm` (live also `--i-understand-live`)

Do not scrape logs, query PostgreSQL, print secrets, or give operator/research skills trading authority.
